  "status": "supported",
  "note": "Tables are reduced to the columns session history needs. Empty native objects exercise the published optional replay-data fields without inventing provider-specific keys. Compaction is recognized bookkeeping, not a new conversation turn; this case does not claim replay of native.messages.",
